# Routine "Friday prospecting recap": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Friday, what went out this week, what came back, which rows are waiting on you, and where the list is running thin.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/pg && pi -p "/friday-prospecting-recap"
